# The builder image needs only the pinned-input file and the Mix manifests.
# Sources are never copied into the image: they arrive at run time through the
# Makefile's /workspace bind mount. Restricting the build context to the
# manifests here is what lets the Containerfile warm the dependency caches
# with a single `COPY .`, and it keeps the cache-warming layer invalidated
# only by a manifest or lockfile change, never by a source edit.
**
!mix.exs
!mix.lock
!config/
!config/*.exs
!third-party/sources.lock
